+# TLS certificate verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification stays enabled on all builds, including development builds; there is no exception that disables it for local development or testing. This is consistent with the recorded decision to enforce HTTPS everywhere, with no plaintext exception for any service.
